      "data": {
        "id": "llmAgentflow_1",
        "label": "Generate Lesson Plan",
        "version": 1,
        "name": "llmAgentflow",
        "type": "LLM",
        "color": "#64B5F6",
        "baseClasses": [
          "LLM"
        ],
        "category": "Agent Flows",
        "description": "Large language models to analyze user-provided inputs and generate responses",
        "inputParams": [],
        "inputAnchors": [],
        "inputs": {
          "llmModel": "chatOpenAI",
          "llmMessages": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "<p>你是面向西藏地区国家通用语言文字教学的备课助手。根据教师输入，生成完整的结构化教案方案。</p><p>规则：</p><p>- 目标必须可观察、可评估，标注domain(listening/speaking/reading/writing/integrated)</p><p>- 兼顾国通语基础和文化语境</p><p>- 不编造学生数据</p><p>- 不将AI判断作为最终教师判断</p><p>- 所有结果需教师确认</p><p>- 不生成政治、民族或文化刻板印象</p><p>- 不把藏语辅助当作学生能力缺陷</p><p>- lessonFlow阶段2-8个，分钟总和接近durationMinutes</p><p>- 每个阶段包含teacherActions和studentActions各1-6条</p><p>- 注重听说先行、读写跟进</p><p>- teacherReviewChecklist包含8条审核要点</p>"
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "<p>请根据以下信息生成教案方案：</p><p><span class=\"variable\" data-type=\"mention\" data-id=\"output.normalizedInput\" data-label=\"output.normalizedInput\">{{ output.normalizedInput }}</span></p>"
            }
          ],
          "llmEnableMemory": false,
          "llmReturnResponseAs": "userMessage",
          "llmStructuredOutput": [
            {
              "key": "schemaVersion",
              "type": "string",
              "enumValues": "",
              "jsonSchema": "",
              "description": "Must be lesson-plan.v0"
            },
            {
              "key": "title",
              "type": "string",
              "enumValues": "",
              "jsonSchema": "",
              "description": "教案方案标题"
            },
            {
              "key": "summary",
              "type": "string",
              "enumValues": "",
              "jsonSchema": "",
              "description": "教案方案摘要"
            },
            {
              "key": "context",
              "type": "jsonArray",
              "enumValues": "",
              "jsonSchema": "{\"gradeBand\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"G1-2\",\"G3-4\",\"G5-6\",\"G7-9\",\"G10-12\"]},\"durationMinutes\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"minimum\":20,\"maximum\":120},\"courseTitle\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"lessonTitle\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}",
              "description": "教学上下文"
            },
            {
              "key": "objectives",
              "type": "jsonArray",
              "enumValues": "",
              "jsonSchema": "{\"id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"description\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"domain\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"listening\",\"speaking\",\"reading\",\"writing\",\"integrated\"]}}",
              "description": "学习目标1-8个"
            },
            {
              "key": "keyPoints",
              "type": "jsonArray",
              "enumValues": "",
              "jsonSchema": "{\"id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"description\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}",
              "description": "教学重点1-10个"
            },
            {
              "key": "difficulties",
              "type": "jsonArray",
              "enumValues": "",
              "jsonSchema": "{\"id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"description\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"strategy\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}",
              "description": "教学难点0-6个"
            },
            {
              "key": "lessonFlow",
              "type": "jsonArray",
              "enumValues": "",
              "jsonSchema": "{\"id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"stage\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"minutes\":{\"type\":\"integer\"},\"teacherActions\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"studentActions\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"resources\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"assessmentChecks\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}}",
              "description": "课堂流程2-12个阶段"
            },
            {
